WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
This is a demo subtitle track for Finderella.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Every title currently plays sample footage.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Real media and real dialogue will arrive with the backend.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Until then, enjoy these placeholder captions.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
You can switch languages from the captions menu.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Still watching? The demo reel keeps rolling.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Two minutes in — the plot thickens.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:05.000
Halfway checkpoint of our imaginary story.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:05.000
The finale approaches.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:35.000
The end. Roll credits.
